%% State diagram: booking and its ticket
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Confirmed: payment approved, _book() saves booking (ticket Valid)
  Confirmed --> CheckedIn: staff check-in (ticket Used)
  Confirmed --> Cancelled: cancel (see refund rules)
  Confirmed --> Expired: booking date passed without check-in
  CheckedIn --> Reviewed: customer rates 0 to 5
  Expired --> Reviewed: customer rates 0 to 5
  CheckedIn --> [*]
  Expired --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
  Reviewed --> [*]
  note left of Cancelled
    Booker: 100% at 48 h+, 50% at 24 to 48 h, refused under 24 h.
    Vendor or admin (reason needed) or event deleted: 100%.
  end note
  note right of Expired
    Checked in and Expired are shown statuses,
    computed in _booking_dict() from the ticket and the date
  end note
